## # i18n/detect
##
## System language detection via the sysinfo package.
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).

import "sysinfo" as sysinfo_pkg

## Returns the best system locale tag, falling back to default_lang.
##
## ### Parameters
## - `default_lang`: Fallback tag when detection yields nothing. Defaults to `"en"`.
##
## ### Returns
## Locale tag such as `"tr-TR"` or `"en"`.
pub function detect_lang(default_lang: string = "en") -> string
    return sysinfo_pkg::system_lang(default_lang)
end
